'印度-希腊诸王': [[-250,['巴克特里亚的希腊人自立','The Greeks of Bactria break away'],['塞琉古已经管不到这么远。','Too far east for the Seleucids to hold.']],[-180,['翻过兴都库什山南下','South over the Hindu Kush'],['希腊军队进入印度河流域,印度-希腊诸王国由此开始。','Greek armies enter the Indus basin; the Indo-Greek kingdoms begin.']],[-165,['米南德一世即位','Menander I comes to the throne'],['最强的一位;佛典里叫他弥兰陀王。','The strongest of them; Buddhist texts call him Milinda.']],[-130,['米南德一世去世','Death of Menander'],['希腊作家普鲁塔克记下:各城分他的骨灰建塔——一位希腊国王得了佛式的葬礼,而记下这件事的是希腊人自己。','The Greek writer Plutarch records that the cities divided his ashes for stupas — a Greek king given a Buddhist funeral, written down by a Greek.']],[10,['最后几位国王消失','The last kings disappear'],['斯特拉托二世与三世之后,这条线上再没有名字留下来;确切在哪一年,学界给的是公元前后二三十年的一段。','After Strato II and III no further name survives on this line; the exact year is given only as a span of two or three decades around the turn of the era.']]],
