'伐卡塔卡与德干诸国': [[220,['百乘解体','The Satavahanas break up'],['德干没有再出现统一政权,而是几家并立。','No single power replaced them; several shared the plateau.']],[390,['笈多公主嫁到德干','A Gupta princess marries into the Deccan'],['普拉巴瓦蒂古普塔后来替年幼的儿子摄政约二十年。','Prabhavatigupta later governed as regent for her small sons for some twenty years.']],[409,['笈多灭西萨特拉普','The Guptas destroy the Western Kshatrapas'],['西海岸的港口从此归了北方。','The west-coast ports pass to the north.']],[470,['阿旃陀第二期洞窟','The second phase at Ajanta'],['壁画最精美的那批,在伐卡塔卡王哈里塞纳手里完成。','The caves with the great paintings are completed under king Harishena.']],[550,['遮娄其兴起','The Chalukyas rise'],['高原换了主角,分立的格局没有变。','The plateau changes protagonists, not its habit of division.']]],
